      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبْ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَابِ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبِى</span></b> , (S, K,) [but
respecting the second of these words see 4,]
<i>Cries to horses, meaning, Come! Approach!</i>
(S, K,) or <i>Advance boldly!</i> (K.)

